                    </Fill>
                </TextStylePaint>
                <TextValueRun styleId="235983:17" text="STORY: the dip to black on `dark`: an empty dark cardboard world, no sky. On `then` a single gold word of light arcs across the dark and bursts into a sun; the sky floods dawn to teal, and land and water tear in beneath it, flat cardboard shapes rising into place (`spake`). On `only` the word of light hangs in the air and a tree grows up under it, as if drawn out of the word (`itself`)." name="brief" id="235983:20"/>
            </Text>
